						<command class_type='comment' title='' comment='This project demonstrates the subject of grouping and targets for motors

Simulation settings are configured in the properties menu for each
component.

The lower solenoid has a target corresponding to the grouping of the
middle and the upper solenoid. named &quot;middleandupperblock&quot;.

The middle solenoid has a target of the &quot;uppersolenoidBlock&quot;.

When any solenoid is enabled in the flowcode, the target of the 
solenoid is moved.' ccode='' textshow='1' textmode='0' textarea='12,0,12,0' break='0' mark='0' disable='0' hide='0' customize='0' />
